<title>UK: BPI unit sets $150 mln preference shares. [CORRECTED 18:00 GMT 05/12]</title>
<headline>BPI unit sets $150 mln preference shares. [CORRECTED 18:00 GMT 05/12]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to preference shares from perpetual FRN)</p>
<p>The following Euro-preference share  issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch International Ltd.</p>
<p>(Corrects issue from subordinated structured floating-rate)</p>
<p> BORROWER   BPI CAPITAL FINANCE LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANCO PORTUGUES DE INVESTIMENTO SA</p>
<p> AMT	  $150 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +195 BP   PAY DATE    18.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   3.15</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALLABLE AT PAR ON COUPON DATES AFTER SEVEN YEARS.</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 25	  SALE LIMITS US/PT/CAY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW CAYMAN/ENG   HOME CTRY  PORTUGAL  TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.15	SELL CONC  2.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
